  '{2}',
  'Option C (The advantage of lower per-unit costs due to AWS''s large customer base and infrastructure purchases) correctly describes economies of scale. AWS, by operating at a massive scale, can achieve lower costs for infrastructure, power, and personnel, and pass those savings on to customers. Option A (The ability to deploy infrastructure globally in minutes) describes global reach and agility. Option B (The automatic distribution of workloads across multiple Availability Zones) describes high availability and fault tolerance. Option D (The flexibility to choose between different operating systems for Amazon EC2 instances) describes flexibility and choice, which is a benefit but not specifically economies of scale.',
  NOW(),
  'quiz_domain60_13',
  NOW(),
  12,
  NULL,
  NULL,
  'm_60_1',
  'medium'
) ON CONFLICT (id) DO NOTHING;

INSERT INTO public.question (id, text, type, options, correct_answer, explanation, created_at, quiz_id, modified_at, index, pairs, matches, module_id, difficulty)
VALUES (
  'q_60_m_60_1_74',
  'A company is considering migrating its on-premises data center to the AWS Cloud. They want to understand how this move could reduce their upfront capital expenditure. Which AWS Cloud benefit is most relevant to this consideration?',
  'mcq',
  '["Agility","Eliminating guessing on infrastructure capacity","Trade capital expense for variable expense","Increased speed and innovation"]'::json,
  '{2}',
  'Option C (Trade capital expense for variable expense) is the most relevant benefit. Migrating to the AWS Cloud allows companies to move from a capital expenditure (CapEx) model, where they invest heavily in hardware upfront, to an operational expenditure (OpEx) model, paying only for the resources they consume. Option A (Agility) refers to the ability to rapidly develop and deploy applications. Option B (Eliminating guessing on infrastructure capacity) is a benefit of elasticity, which helps avoid over-provisioning. Option D (Increased speed and innovation) refers to the ability to experiment and iterate quickly. While all are cloud benefits, trading CapEx for OpEx directly addresses the reduction of upfront capital expenditure.',
  NOW(),
  'quiz_domain60_13',
  NOW(),
  13,
  NULL,
  NULL,
  'm_60_1',
  'medium'
) ON CONFLICT (id) DO NOTHING;

