  '{2}',
  'Option C (correct) is Security groups, which act as a virtual firewall for your EC2 instances, controlling inbound and outbound traffic at the instance level and are stateful. Option A (incorrect) operates at the subnet level and is stateless. Option B (incorrect) is a web application firewall. Option D (incorrect) provides DDoS protection. This question tests the fundamental understanding of security groups (ap-2.4-001).',
