  '{2}',
  'Option C (correct) is the primary purpose of an Internet Gateway (IGW). An IGW is a horizontally scaled, redundant, and highly available VPC component that allows communication between instances in your VPC and the internet. Option A describes a NAT Gateway. Option B describes AWS Direct Connect or AWS VPN. Option D describes Network ACLs.',
