  '{2}',
  'Option C (correct) is Amazon Route 53, a highly available and scalable cloud Domain Name System (DNS) web service. It can register domain names and route internet traffic to the resources hosted on AWS. Option A (Amazon VPC) provides isolated virtual networks. Option B (Amazon CloudFront) is a content delivery network. Option D (Elastic Load Balancing) distributes traffic across targets.',
