  '{1}',
  'Option B (correct) is Amazon Kinesis, which is designed for real-time processing of large streams of data. It can ingest and process data continuously, making it ideal for clickstream analysis and anomaly detection that requires immediate action. Option A (incorrect) is AWS Glue, an ETL service primarily used for batch processing and preparing data for analytics, not for real-time streaming. Option C (incorrect) is Amazon S3, an object storage service, suitable for storing large datasets but not for real-time ingestion and processing. Option D (incorrect) is Amazon Redshift, a data warehousing service optimized for analytical queries on large datasets, typically used for batch analytics rather than real-time stream processing.',
  NOW(),
