  '{1}',
  'Option B (correct) Amazon Kinesis is a platform for streaming data on AWS, including Kinesis Video Streams for processing real-time video. It allows you to ingest, process, and analyze real-time data streams. Option A (Amazon S3) is object storage, not for real-time streaming. Option C (AWS Glue) is an ETL service for batch and streaming data, but Kinesis is the primary ingestion and processing service for real-time streams. Option D (Amazon QuickSight) is a business intelligence service for data visualization, not real-time stream processing.',
  NOW(),
  'quiz_domain62_13',
  NOW(),
  181,
  NULL,
  NULL,
  'm_62_7',
