  'Option C (correct) is Amazon EventBridge, a serverless event bus that makes it easy to connect applications together using data from your own apps, integrated SaaS apps, and AWS services. It simplifies event-driven architectures by routing events from sources to targets. Option A (Amazon SQS) is a message queuing service. Option B (Amazon SNS) is a notification service. Option D (AWS Lambda) is a serverless compute service.',
