  '{1}',
  'Option B (correct) is AWS Amplify, a complete solution that enables frontend web and mobile developers to build, ship, and host full-stack applications on AWS. It simplifies the process of integrating various AWS services. Option A (Amazon EC2) provides virtual servers. Option C (AWS Lambda) is for serverless functions. Option D (Amazon Lightsail) is for simple web applications and virtual private servers, but Amplify offers a broader set of tools for full-stack development.',
