  '{1,2}',
  'Option B (Amazon RDS) is a managed relational database service that supports various database engines like MySQL, PostgreSQL, Oracle, and SQL Server. Option C (Amazon Aurora) is a high-performance, MySQL and PostgreSQL-compatible relational database built for the cloud, offering superior performance and availability. Option A (Amazon DynamoDB) is a NoSQL database. Option D (Amazon Redshift) is a data warehousing service. Option E (Amazon ElastiCache) is an in-memory caching service.',
